# Device-resident buffers of a persistent simulation (D[resident-buffers]),
# scenario sanitize of Driver/Inputs/python_resident.py, under
# compute-sanitizer: parts that continue one activation of the entry, the
# copies of the state at their ends and to the host, an update of tunables
# that ends an activation and begins another, a part that fails, and
# simulations that end with their activations, with no access beyond a
# buffer and no read of memory that nothing has written.
#
# REQUIRES: cuda, compute-sanitizer, python-api
#
# RUN: %compute_sanitizer --tool memcheck --error-exitcode 1 %mdir_python \
# RUN:   %S/../Driver/Inputs/python_resident.py %S/../Driver/Inputs/dipeptide GPU sanitize 2>&1 \
# RUN:   | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %compute_sanitizer --tool initcheck --error-exitcode 1 %mdir_python \
# RUN:   %S/../Driver/Inputs/python_resident.py %S/../Driver/Inputs/dipeptide GPU sanitize 2>&1 \
# RUN:   | FileCheck %s

# CHECK: steps 13, a part that failed, three simulations
# CHECK: resident sanitize passed
# CHECK: ERROR SUMMARY: 0 errors
